<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sunday's English</p>
<p>premier league soccer match:</p>
<p>Liverpool 2 (Fowler 47 and 51) Derby 1 (Ward 89). Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 39,515.</p>
